    <bpmn:process id="W_W3207" name="W3207. Intercompany Rent Benchmarking &amp; Transfer Pricing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual TP cycle (links to VS-72); new intercompany lease (W3193); renewal (W3197)
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: ~50 intercompany leases (the owned-site portfolio per W119; the ~205 total lease portfolio is predominantly third-party per W1183)
Owner: Transfer Pricing Manager
Participants: Transfer Pricing Mgr, Tax (links to VS-79), Finance (links to VS-72), Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate, External TP Advisor
Source: workflow W3207 — Intercompany Rent Benchmarking &amp; Transfer Pricing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3207_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3207_Lane1" name="TP Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3207_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3207_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3207_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3207_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3207_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3207_Start3" name="Annual TP cycle (links to VS-72); new intercompany lease (W3193); renewal (W3197)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3207_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3207_Task4" name="Transfer Pricing Mgr/TP Advisor conduct annual arm&#x27;s-length benchmarking for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Transfer Pricing Mgr/TP Advisor conduct annual arm&#x27;s-length benchmarking for intercompany rent: comparable uncontrolled price (CUP) using third-party lease comps (W3194 market deals) and market data, build per-sqm market rent range by location class (NCR/Visayas/Mindanao, mall vs standalone, store format); document methodology per BIR RR 02-2013 and OECD guidelines
Responsible (R): TP Mgr / External TP Advisor
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: 4–8 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3207_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3207_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3207_Task5" name="Compare intercompany rent charged (W3193/W3195) to arm&#x27;s-length range; adjust…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compare intercompany rent charged (W3193/W3195) to arm&#x27;s-length range; adjust where outside range; document in TP documentation (master file, local file, country-by-country where applicable); ensure consistency between rent charged, RPT basis (W3202), and valuation inputs (W3189)
Responsible (R): TP Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3207_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3207_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3207_Task6" name="Defend on BIR audit (links to VS-79.3/VS-22.2): produce TP documentation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Defend on BIR audit (links to VS-79.3/VS-22.2): produce TP documentation, benchmarking, comparables, and contemporaneous evidence; manage any BIR adjustment, interest, and penalty; update framework (W3193)
Responsible (R): TP Mgr / Legal / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3207_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3207_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
